\u22120?\u30340?\u21344?\u29992?\u-31997?\u22260?\u20250?\u23548?\u-32268?\u-29307?\u-28803?\u-244?\u20294?B\u23545?\u22788?\u29702?\u22120?\u30340?\u21344?\u29992?\u32763?\u20493?\u24182?\u19981?\u20250?\u23548?\u-32268?\u22788?\u29702?\u22120?\u-29307?\u-28803?\u12290?\u30001?\u27492?\u25105?\u20204?\u21487?\u20197?\u30475?\u20986?\u-244?\u22312?\u20998?\u26512?\u26576?\u19968?\u-26503?\u-29372?\u28304?\u30340?\u20351?\u29992?\u24773?\u20917?\u26102?\u-244?______\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u-30335?\u-32765?\u-31151?\u-29372?\u28304?\u30340?\u24635?\u20307?\u21033?\u29992?\u24773?\u20917?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u-30335?\u-32765?\u-31151?\u21508?\u-26503?\u19981?\u21516?\u26381?\u21153?\u23545?\u-29723?\u-26503?\u-29372?\u28304?\u30340?\u21344?\u29992?\u24773?\u20917?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u26082?\u-30335?\u-32765?\u-31151?\u-29372?\u28304?\u30340?\u24635?\u20307?\u21033?\u29992?\u24773?\u20917?\u-244?\u-28712?\u-30335?\u-32765?\u-31151?\u21508?\u-26503?\u19981?\u21516?\u26381?\u21153?\u23545?\u-29723?\u-26503?\u-29372?\u28304?\u30340?\u21344?\u29992?\u24773?\u20917?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u-29372?\u28304?\u30340?\u24635?\u20307?\u21033?\u29992?\u24773?\u20917?\u19982?\u21508?\u-26503?\u19981?\u21516?\u26381?\u21153?\u23545?\u-29723?\u-26503?\u-29372?\u28304?\u30340?\u21344?\u29992?\u24773?\u20917?\u21462?\u20854?\u20013?\u-28797?\u20026?\u-28211?\u-30335?\u30340?\u19968?\u20010?\u26041?\u-26782?\u-32765?\u-31151?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 66\u12289?\u30005?\u23376?\u-28498?\u20214?\u22320?\u22336?liuhy@163.coM\u20013?\u-244?\u8220?liuhy\u8221?\u26159?______\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u29992?\u25143?\u21517? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u22495?\u21517? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u26381?\u21153?\u22120?\u21517?D\u-242?ISP\u21517?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 67\u12289?WWW\u26381?\u21153?\u22120?\u19982?\u23458?\u25143?\u26426?\u20043?\u-27148?\u20027?\u-30335?\u-28217?\u29992?______\u21327?\u-29778?\u-28709?\u-30644?\u32593?\u-26507?\u30340?\u21457?\u-28671?\u21644?\u25509?\u25910?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?HTTP \u160? \u160?B\u-242?URL \u160? \u160?C\u-242?SMTP D\u-242?HTML\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 68\u12289?5\u31867?\u-26786?\u23631?\u-31427?\u21452?\u32478?\u32447?(UTP)\u30001?______\u23545?\u23548?\u32447?\u32452?\u25104?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?2 \u160? \u160?B\u-242?3 \u160? \u160?C\u-242?4 D\u-242?5\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 69\u12289?\u20197?\u19979?\u21015?\u20986?\u30340?IP\u22320?\u22336?\u20013?\u-244?______\u19981?\u-32515?\u20316?\u20026?\u30446?\u26631?\u22320?\u22336?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?100.10.255.255 B\u-242?127.0.0.1 \u160? \u160?C\u-242?0.0.0.0 D\u-242?10.0.0.1\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 70\u12289?\u19977?\u23618?B/S\u32467?\u26500?\u20013?\u21253?\u25324?\u27983?\u-30264?\u22120?\u12289?\u26381?\u21153?\u22120?\u21644?______\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u-30237?\u-28214?\u22120? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u25991?\u20214?\u31995?\u32479? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u32531?\u23384? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u25968?\u25454?\u24211?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 A management information system \f1\fs24\ul 71\ul0\f4\fs24  the business managers the information that they need to make decisions. Early business computers were used for simple operations such \u160?\f1\fs24\ul 72\ul0\f4\fs24  tracking inventory, billing, sales, or payroll data, with little detail or structure. Over time. these computer applicationsbecame more complex, hardware storage capacities grew, and technologies improved for connecting previously \f1\fs24\ul 73\ul0\f4\fs24  applications. As more data was stored and linked, managers sought greater abstraction as well as greater detail with the aim of creating significant management reports from the raw, \u160?stored \f1\fs24\ul 74\ul0\f4\fs24  . Originally\u-244?the term "MIS" described applications providing managers with information about sales, inventories, and other data that would help in \u160?\f1\fs24\ul 75\ul0\f4\fs24  the enterprise. Over time, the term broadened to include\u-230?decision support systems\u-244?resource management and human resource management\u-244?enterprise resource planning(ERP), enterprise performance management(EPM), supply chain management(SCM)\u-244?customer relationship management(CRM)\u-244?project management and database retrieval applications\u-242?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 71\u12289?A\u-242?brings \u160? \u160?B\u-242?gives \u160? \u160?C\u-242?takes D\u-242?provides\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 72\u12289?A\u-242?as \u160? \u160?B\u-242?to \u160? \u160?C\u-242?as to D\u-242?that\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 73\u12289?A\u-242?special \u160? \u160?B\u-242?obvious \u160? \u160?C\u-242?isolated D\u-242?individual\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 74\u12289?A\u-242?data \u160? \u160?B\u-242?number \u160? \u160?C\u-242?word D\u-242?detail\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 75\u12289?A\u-242?setting up \u160? \u160?B\u-242?founding \u160? \u160?C\u-242?improving D\u-242?managing\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \u31572?\u26696?:\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f1\fs28\b \u21333?\u-26503?\u-28663?\u25321?\u-26472?\b0\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 1\u12289?B\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 [\u-30237?\u26512?] \u26412?\u-32765?\u28857?\u-32765?\u26597?\u20851?\u20110?\u-29791?\u31639?\u26426?\u22522?\u26412?\u32452?\u25104?\u21644?\u-29791?\u31639?\u26426?\u30340?\u31995?\u32479?\u32467?\u26500?\u30340?\u22522?\u26412?\u27010?\u24565?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?\u-29791?\u31639?\u26426?\u22522?\u26412?\u32452?\u25104?\u21253?\u25324?\u20013?\u22830?\u22788?\u29702?\u22120?\u12289?\u23384?\u20648?\u22120?\u12289?\u24120?\u29992?I/O\u-29762?\u22791?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?CPU\u26159?\u-29791?\u31639?\u26426?\u30340?\u25511?\u21046?\u20013?\u24515?\u